&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Associate Solutions Architect to join our Applied AI team and help drive the adoption of Claude Code across our enterprise customers. As an Associate SA specializing in Claude Code, you&#39;ll be the technical bridge between our cutting-edge AI coding assistant and the engineering teams who can transform their productivity with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Account Executives to demonstrate Claude Code&#39;s capabilities, guide technical evaluations, and help engineering organizations successfully deploy and scale Claude Code across their development workflows. This is an opportunity to work with some of the world&#39;s most innovative companies that leverage AI to accelerate software development.&lt;/p&gt;
